# video_frame_get_linesizes for every format and a few widths (8 entries; unused planes are 0).
# Width 6 (even) and 5 (odd) show HALF(w) = (w+1)/2 for subsampled chroma planes.
# Unknown format values (26, 99) and NONE give all zeros.
linesizes 0 6
linesizes 1 6
linesizes 2 6
linesizes 3 6
linesizes 4 6
linesizes 5 6
linesizes 6 6
linesizes 7 6
linesizes 8 6
linesizes 9 6
linesizes 10 6
